Accelerometer / gyro / ambient light on the Y700 Gen 4 go through the ADSP
(SSC). They need hexagonrpcd, libssc and the patched iio-sensor-proxy from
external-and-mods/tb322fc-linux (sources.json + patches/), built natively,
plus calibration data copied read-only from YOUR OWN Android
(external-and-mods/tb322fc-linux/docs/rootfs.md, "Sensors: data and services").
The SteamOS image does not ship those binaries, so these units are only
staged here and are NOT enabled. Game Mode does not need them.
